<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>tuchka</Major>
    <Description>Fortnite edit macro : G=edit  7=select building

Its really fast so if it lags i assume no liability
so be carefu

set the macro mode to "execute until the key is pressed again ", otherwise you will not turn it off</Description>
    <Comment>The delay is 0.5 seconds or 5milliseconds</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 5 ms
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 10 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 36 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 36 1
Delay 5 ms
GoWhile 1 10000000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>